                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Just know before you get into this game, it is wacky, strange, and crazy in every kind of way. If you looked at what the game style is and are reading this, you know that. If you can look past it, there is a really enjoyable game in there. Interesting characters, decent controls, hilarious combat. The art style is kind of hilarious as well. The environments come across as rather simple, but honestly just waiting to see what comes next is half the fun. This isn't AAA, it isn't going to wow you, but there is a lot of love and charm here.",
